@startuml care-proposal
hide circle

class BeReferralServiceRequest [[StructureDefinition-be-referral-servicerequest.html]] {
  |_identifier 1..1 Identifier
  |_status 1..1 code
  |_intent 1..1 code
  |_category 1..* CodeableConcept
    |_discipline 1..1 (categories-of-care)
    |_prescriptionType 0..1
  |_code 1..1 CodeableConcept
  |_subject 1..1 Reference(BePatient)
  |_occurrence[x] 0..1
  |_authoredOn 1..1 dateTime
  |_requester 1..1 Reference(BePractitionerRole)
  |_reasonCode 0..* CodeableConcept
  |_basedOn 0..* Reference "fulfils an upstream proposal / plan"
  |_replaces 0..* Reference "continuation of care"
  |_ext.validity 1..1 Period
  |_ext.feedback 0..1 boolean
  |_ext.statusReason 0..1 CodeableConcept
}

class CareProposal [[StructureDefinition-care-proposal.html]] {
  |_category[discipline] = Nursing procedure (fixed)
  |_code from BeVSRequestedServicesNurse
  |_basedOn only Reference(CareProposal)
  |_reasonCode 1..* from BeVSCareProposalReasonCode
  |_requester 1..1
  |_occurrenceTiming weekly (frequency 1 / 1 wk)
  |_(inv) intent = order implies basedOn exists
}

BeReferralServiceRequest <|-- CareProposal

note right of CareProposal
  Proposal-and-approval flow (formerly Annex 81).
  The approval links back to the proposal via basedOn.
end note

@enduml
